      <div class="body-copy">
        <p style="margin: 0;">
          AI was a strong accelerator, but one moment taught me how to handle it. For the GitHub structure, its proposal was to handle the data on a single .md file. It sounded confident, but I only saw how fragile it was while implementing it. From there I learned to ask AI to walk me through its reasoning, weigh opposite technical alternatives, and validate with people who know the domain. Collaborating with domain experts is still necessary. AI remains a tool.
